      "id": 93268,
      "title": "The Prompting Company - We help products get mentioned in ChatGPT",
      "tagline": "Not just analytics - The Prompting Company helps your products get mentioned in AI answers",
      "body": "YC, WE’RE BACK!\n\nWe’re Kevin, Albert, and Michelle from W20, back in S25 building The Prompting Company: we help products get mentioned in ChatGPT.\n\n[**https://youtu.be/xZgytNL1FTs?si=IwuGoy0JOs9dRS9**\\_](https://youtu.be/xZgytNL1FTs?si=IwuGoy0JOs9dRS9_)\n\n**The problem:**\n\nPeople are no longer searching on Google. They’re ASKING AI. If your product doesn’t appear in AI answers, you’re dead.\n\n**How it works:**\n\n1. Find & analyze user questions: We find the exact questions your users ask and check how often your product is mentioned.\n2. Create content: We tell you what to post, where to post, and do it for you.\n3. Route to AI-optimized page: We redirect AI traffic to AI-optimized page\n\n**The team:**\n\nBefore starting The Prompting Company, Kevin, Albert, and Michelle co-founded Typedream (YC W20), an AI website builder acquired by beehiiv, and previously built Cotter, a passwordless authentication SDK acquired by Stytch.\n\n**Offer:** Get your free AI visibility report → [**promptingcompany.com**](http://promptingcompany.com)\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=93268&key=user_uploads/379052/627d5d4b-ce30-4be6-ad03-abae39f73450)\n\n",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/OGK-the-prompting-company-we-help-products-get-mentioned-in-chatgpt",
